threads.body:
> Rows are the 10 attributes the registry declares on this metric; columns are the 40 targets that emitted it.

looks better without a line break.

We can move the `max-width` to apply only to the details paragraph:

```suggestion
.lede {
  color: var(--ink-2);
  margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}
.lede summary {
  cursor: pointer;
}
.lede p {
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  max-width: 86ch;
}
```

I chose `86ch` so the paragraph renders on three lines with the line breaks so the sentences remain most readable.

